## Key Learnings

- Static websites do not require dedicated virtual machines for hosting.
- Cloudflare Pages simplifies deployment and infrastructure management.
- Cloudflare Managed SSL eliminates manual certificate renewal.
- Migrating DNS management to Cloudflare centralizes domain and SSL management.
- Serverless static hosting significantly reduces operational effort and infrastructure costs while improving reliability and performance.
